{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_02_beg","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_02","title":"墨魎","storyCode":"WR-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"442b6f712aa7fe12e82c751acd15dbe44ef5c96547ca6c16afbce5e923bed5cd","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，是替朋友尋找親人，為此不遠萬里來到大炎，實在令人欽佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，灰齊山，勾吳城？我可從來沒有聽說過附近有這樣的城市......不過這裡離天岳倒是不遠。興許是某座不知名的小山頭，也有可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？天岳.....？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，請問我們現在在大炎的哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"此地在婆山地界，名為婆山鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒聽過，絕對沒聽過！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那今年的年份是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"今年是景祚七年，如今已過立春，恰逢除夕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）景祚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）恩人呐，不瞞你說，我歷史學得不好，但景祚......起碼近幾百年，都未曾聽過這麼個年號啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）怎、怎麼回事啊恩人？難不成我們這一推門回到一千年前了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）一千年前會有這種園林建築嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）顯然不會！莫非是這位煮傘居士信口開河？可我看他文質彬彬的，不至於吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"三位英雄，你們幫了忙，就是我的貴客，有什麼問題直問便是，大可不用客氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......能勞煩您給我們講述一下這裡的風土人情嗎？實不相瞞，這裡並不是我們一開始的目的地，看來是迷了路，有些茫然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"比如......比如就說說這座城鎮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......婆山鎮的來歷可就大有說法了。相傳七十年前，某個富商家起了一場大火，殃及無數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"富商受了驚，打算離開那裡，另尋一塊風水寶地作為自己頤養天年的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，同鎮的人們卻在滿地灰燼中，找到了一幅古怪的畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。房屋都燒得一乾二淨，那幅畫卻安然無恙，撣去灰燼後，完好如初。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"富商聽說了這幅畫的事，掏了大價錢重新買了回來，圖個辟火消災的吉利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"富商在新居裡，越看這畫中風水，越覺得中意。便發動上百家僕，去尋找這畫卷中描繪的山水寶地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"——於是就到了這裡，有了這座鎮，有了這園林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......是您的祖輩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"非也非也，世事無常。幾十年前，富商死後，幾個兒子都不學無術，散盡家財。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧我爹因為某些機緣巧合，有一筆閒錢，這才買下了這座園子，定居於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"之後，因為這附近少有天災，山川秀美，吸引了不少風流雅士，久而久之，婆山鎮就有了今天這般規模。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"（聽上去真奇妙呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（好像沒有什麼問題......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那，這天色......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"天色？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，就是，白天和黑夜好像混在一起了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我們素來日出而作，日落而息，幾位有何疑慮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"從鐘聲響起到現在，兩個小時......差不多有一個時辰了。太陽的位置從來沒有變化過，這是什麼原因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"太陽？變化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"日月懸空，日在東，月在西，千古不易，變換什麼位置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？各位怎麼露出這副臉色？我說了什麼不妥當的話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，恩人，打斷一下，打斷一下啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"敢問先生明天是不是也會在這裡說書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"那自然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"既然明天如此，那想必昨天也是這一把摺扇，一塊醒木？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"賦閒在家，只有收集怪書這一個癖好，只靠說書打發時間。故而每日申時，雷打不動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那這日月恒定不落，“今天明天昨天”，這“一天”，要怎麼定義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"烏兄真有意思，十二個時辰為一天，這還用問嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......十二時辰，二十四小時，指的不是一晝夜的時間嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"噫，奇了怪哉，幾位究竟是從何處而來的？十二時辰，指的是從極東日出之地，到極西月出之山之間所需的時間呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，也指這段路途的路段劃分，婆山鎮自東到西，便是由巳到亥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說山外有山，難道鴻洞山外，東升河下，其他的地方不是如此？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"這......光是一個婆山鎮就占了這麼大地盤，其他地方要是有鎮子，不得永無天日啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"或者永遠是白天，睡覺都睡不好呢，真糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這我還真不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你從沒有離開過鎮子嗎？這裡沒有其他遊客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"從來沒有。很少有人來這裡，而離開這裡的年輕人，也很少回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞞幾位，我們如今所知道的“大炎”，也不過是從富商留下的一些藏書中獲悉的罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......這裡沒有遭遇過天災？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"同樣極少。除了典籍記載，至少我們這三代人，從未見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"正因此，我們從不輕易離開婆山鎮地界。也正如你所見，來此地的遊客都寥寥無幾，更別提官差和信使一類的人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"說如今的婆山鎮與世隔絕，絲毫不為過。只不過，也唯有不問世事，方能愜意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那些怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......不知從何時開始，每逢除夕前後，鴻洞山裡時常會有些妖物來騷擾城鎮，大概三五天時間，這麼多年了，一直如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年，我翻遍典籍，問遍了那少之又少的外鄉人，從未找到解決之法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不過只要躲到有太陽的地方，那些妖物就不敢靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"與其冒著風險去和那些怪物拼個你死我活，不如求個平平安安，躲在太陽底下，不過一夜不眠而已......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"久而久之，就成了我們這裡的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！我還以為這裡當真是世外桃源，居然還會有這種麻煩事......那些怪物，太過恐怖，不主動靠近，是明智之舉啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）恩人呐，這聽著也太邪門了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生，這是最後一個請求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"您也知道我們來這裡，是來找人的。我這裡有一件，呃，信物，您見過嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......巧奪天工啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......很遺憾，如此非凡的物件，我若是見過，一定——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，宴席已經備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，請問幾位在鎮上可有住處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"來者是客，不如就在這裡歇息一段時日，等除夕過了，再趕路不遲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）恩人，您看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）反正也沒地方去......不如留在鎮子上收集情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）這裡顯然和我們知道的“大炎”有很多不同的地方，以及，我們是怎麼到這裡來的，還是沒有頭緒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"那咱們就，恭敬不如從命啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"到頭來還是沒有任何線索......不過這裡的茶起來著好香，這是大炎的綠茶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛絲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係啦，我有分寸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"能喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"放在這兒的水果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，恩人是要試毒？早說啊，我來我來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"喂......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，恩人呐，這水果可水靈了，還怪甜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是那個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事！俗話說得好，防人之心不可無嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不是擔心他們下毒......只是逐步確認......我們四周的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"其實你還挺煩躁的，對吧？沒關係，大家都一樣，一頭霧水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"就像是重新確認自己是不是還活著似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......重新確認嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在這裡休息吧，我還是要去外面看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼能讓恩人獨自勞累呢！我陪您一起去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就分頭行動吧，現在這個情況，誰都坐不住呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那咱們......一個時辰後見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得他可信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然在荒野上遇見落難者也不是什麼稀罕事，不過巧合這種東西，是最不值得相信的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我想也是，而且他欺騙我們也是事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"離巢的鉗獸是極具攻擊性的。雖然我們找到他的時候，他趴在樹枝上一副悲慘樣......但是那裡離車禍地點有足足八百米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"而且看他的動作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"就算沒有惡意，總是要互相保留一些的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會稍微留意點的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（雖說突然被捲入了莫名怪事......但也算是因禍得福......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（話說回來，這可真——不是鬧著玩的啊......要是找不到回去的辦法，該怎麼辦......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（唔......但炎熔和克洛絲確實有恩於我，這也不能賴她們......唉！走一步看一步吧——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦，抱歉抱歉，實在抱歉，看我一直想事情，一時間都沒注意前面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"你看著面生，想必是外邊來的吧？小僧已經很久沒見過外來客啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧名叫嵯峨，是來自東國的雲遊僧！敢問施主從何處來？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["炎熔","烏有"]}]}
